<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    :root { --text: #1d1d1f; --muted: #6e6e73; --card: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04); --line: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.09); --accent: #0f9d6a; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root { --text: #f5f5f7; --muted: #a1a1a6; --card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07); --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13); --accent: #34d399; }
    }
    body { font: 12.5px/1.45 -apple-system, "SF Pro Text", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif; color: var(--text); margin: 0 2px; }
    h1 { font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; margin: 2px 0 2px; }
    h1 .ver { font-weight: 400; color: var(--muted); }
    .lead { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 10px; }
    .box { padding: 7px 10px; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 7px; }
    .ltr { direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; }
    code { font: 11px "SF Mono", Menlo, monospace; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; }
    b { font-weight: 600; }
    ol { margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 20px; }
    ol li { margin: 0 0 7px; }
    .footer { margin-top: 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11.5px; }
    a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>You&rsquo;re ready</h1>
  <p class="lead">@PLUGIN_DISPLAY_NAME@ @CMAKE_PROJECT_VERSION@ has been installed.</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Open OBS Studio, right-click your camera source and choose <b>Filters</b>.</li>
    <li>Under <b>Effect Filters</b>, click <b>+</b> and add <b>@PLUGIN_DISPLAY_NAME@</b>.</li>
    <li>Keep <b>Screen Type</b> on <b>Auto Detect</b> and click <b>Analyze Screen Now</b>.</li>
    <li>Fine-tune <b>Hair Detail</b> and <b>Despill</b> if needed.</li>
  </ol>
  <p class="box">For the cleanest hair, light the screen evenly and keep <b>AI Person &amp; Hair Protection</b> on.</p>
  <p class="footer">Support: <a href="@PLUGIN_WEBSITE@">@PLUGIN_WEBSITE@</a> &middot; <a href="mailto:@PLUGIN_EMAIL@">@PLUGIN_EMAIL@</a></p>
</body>
</html>
